Floating-Point Precision Issues
===============================

Upstream says they probably will not support any architectures besides
amd64: https://github.com/flexible-collision-library/fcl/issues/474

Other architectures seem to suffer from various amounts of floating point
precision issues. For now, we keep building libfcl on all Debian
architectures, but be advised that in certain edge cases, the library
may return wrong results

 -- Timo Röhling <timo@gaussglocke.de>  Wed, 18 Nov 2020 23:01:40 +0100
